<title>USA: Clover, S.C., yields 5.45 pct in 2016.</title>
<headline>Clover, S.C., yields 5.45 pct in 2016.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons, Inc said it tentatively pric ed $4.740 million of Clover, S.C., waterworks and sewer system improvement revenue bonds, series 1996, with a top yield of 5.45 percent in 2016.</p>
